      <pattern name="Typed grid browse" location="docs/guides/DATAGRID-FRAMEWORK-CONFIGURATION-GUIDE.md">Render the 034 sprk_gridconfiguration via &lt;DataGrid configId=…&gt; + BffDataverseClient read-only.</pattern>
      <pattern name="FR-24 feedback loop" location="projects/spaarke-SPA-external-access-platform-r2/tasks/030-servicerequest-intake-schema.poml">The official human answer writes decision/response fields; 037 renders + emails it.</pattern>
